Z||000008||SLYGUY||12-22-2001||09:49 PM||||All of these ideas sound great. Everybody is headed in the right direction.<P>You forgot the most important item however.<P>When working around fuel and fuel related components :<P>HAVE A WORKING FIRE EXTINGUISHER WITHIN EASY REACH!!!!!!<P>Nobody mentioned it, so to avoid reading about the fiero inferno please do this! I've never had the experience of a freak accidental fire but I keep extinguishers in both my truck and my GT just in case.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ViewImage.jpg"> ||||reg||1
